WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.140
What have you been up to these days?

00:00:01.140 --> 00:00:02.810
I've been busy.

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:05.410
I've been really busy reading
a lot of Andy's tweets.

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:07.040
I'm really excited.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.500
Andy's been tweeting a lot
about some important stuff.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:10.840
Yesterday, he had a great one.

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:11.710
This is a real one, right?

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:13.080
This is a real tweet.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:14.570
He had a great tweet yesterday.

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:15.740
I don't know if we have--
I think we have it.

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:16.573
Yeah, we have it.

00:00:16.573 --> 00:00:17.406
Put it up.
Here we go.

00:00:17.406 --> 00:00:18.850
Just ran over a fallen
orange in the alley.

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:21.940
Car windows open, so received aroma bonus.

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:23.893
Very satisfying. 10 out of 10.

00:00:23.893 --> 00:00:28.412
(audience cheering and applauding)

00:00:28.412 --> 00:00:29.730
I mean.

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:32.640
It's called fan outreach,
you might wanna try it.

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:34.632
It's called hubris, Andy.

00:00:34.632 --> 00:00:35.920
(Conan and audience laughing)

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:37.150
Oh, I just chipped my toenail,

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:38.700
I better alert the whole world!

00:00:41.585 --> 00:00:43.820
I just tried something,
it's called ketchup!

00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:45.050
What are you talking about?

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:46.415
I like to share!

00:00:46.415 --> 00:00:47.248
(Will groans)

00:00:47.248 --> 00:00:49.120
Yeah, it's pretty infuriating
when he does, isn't it?

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:50.720
It is infuriating.

00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:52.474
You've turned me against him!

00:00:52.474 --> 00:00:55.057
(all laughing)

